{"lyrics":"[00:12.42]Off-White on the G-Fazo's\n[00:15.04]Her love's dead, think it needs a halo\n[00:18.22]I'm in my head, damn it, I think too much\n[00:21.16]Now I'm gettin' tear stains on the bankrolls\n[00:23.84]Bro said, If she wanna leave, I should let go\n[00:26.90]Heart sayin', \"If she leave, we're goin' with her, let's go\"\n[00:29.76]I don't wanna let go, girl from 734\n[00:36.06]Time, time heals all wounds, but time can leave the nastiest scars\n[00:42.56]This happened too soon, I'm starting to think I don't know who ya' are\n[00:49.06]Pills get popped as your love gets stopped\n[00:54.08]You just sit and watch as I wheeze and cough\n[01:00.54]I can't breathe at all, I can't breathe it off\n[01:06.66]I can't breathe with all the pain involved\n[01:13.60]Off-White on the G-Fazo's\n[01:16.20]Her love's dead, think it needs a halo\n[01:19.28]I'm in my head, damn it, I think too much\n[01:22.30]Now I'm gettin' tear stains on the bankrolls\n[01:24.98]Bro said, if she wanna leave, I should let go\n[01:28.04]Heart sayin', \"If she leave, we're goin' with her, let's go\"\n[01:30.90]I don't wanna let go, girl from 734\n[01:34.78]In the studio gettin' high with the bros\n[01:39.94]Eyes get big when I see you textin' my phone\n[01:42.98]Codependent, yeah, I hate being alone, and everyone knows\n[01:49.44]Now I gotta deal with this rain again\n[01:51.92]The same rain that you made go away (That you made go away)\n[01:55.00]Now I gotta deal with this heart-throbbin' pain again, the pain feel like It'll never go away (Never go away)\n[02:00.92]Girl, never say you can't forgive me for my mistakes\n[02:06.66]You do things to make me ache, but I love you so much I'll wait, for however long it takes\n[02:14.36]Off-White on the G-Fazo's\n[02:17.36]Her love's dead, think it needs a halo\n[02:20.50]I'm in my head, damn it, I think too much\n[02:23.44]Now I'm gettin' tear stains on the bankrolls\n[02:26.16]Bro said, if she wanna leave, I should let go\n[02:29.26]Heart sayin', \"If she leave, we're goin' with her, let's go\"\n[02:32.04]I don't wanna let go, girl from 734\n[02:39.18]Off-White on the G-Fazo's\n[02:41.80]Her love's dead, think it needs a halo\n[02:44.90]I'm in my head, damn it, I think too much\n[02:47.90]Now I'm gettin' tear stains on the bankrolls\n[02:50.58]Bro said, if she wanna leave, I should let go\n[02:53.68]Heart sayin', \"If she leave, we're goin' with her, let's go\"\n[02:56.50]I don't wanna let go, girl from 734","words":[[12.42,13.06,"Off-White"],[13.16,13.32,"on"],[13.48,13.6,"the"],[13.74,14.58,"G-Fazo's"],[15.04,15.24,"Her"],[15.4,15.72,"love's"],[15.82,16.12,"dead,"],[16.18,16.42,"think"],[16.5,16.52,"it"],[16.56,16.78,"needs"],[16.92,16.92,"a"],[17.0,17.4,"halo"],[18.22,18.28,"I'm"],[18.34,18.4,"in"],[18.46,18.74,"my"],[18.84,19.14,"head,"],[19.22,19.52,"damn"],[19.58,19.68,"it,"],[19.78,19.78,"I"],[20.0,20.26,"think"],[20.36,20.5,"too"],[20.6,21.0,"much"],[21.16,21.34,"Now"],[21.38,21.44,"I'm"],[21.54,21.92,"gettin'"],[21.96,22.12,"tear"],[22.22,22.66,"stains"],[22.76,22.86,"on"],[22.9,22.96,"the"],[23.06,23.8,"bankrolls"],[23.84,23.92,"Bro"],[24.18,24.58,"said,"],[24.68,24.7,"If"],[24.8,24.88,"she"],[25.0,25.26,"wanna"],[25.38,25.74,"leave,"],[25.9,25.9,"I"],[25.96,26.16,"should"],[26.24,26.44,"let"],[26.5,26.58,"go"],[26.9,27.12,"Heart"],[27.24,27.66,"sayin',"],[27.7,27.78,"\"If"],[27.86,27.94,"she"],[28.02,28.26,"leave,"],[28.3,28.38,"we're"],[28.42,28.78,"goin'"],[28.82,29.02,"with"],[29.06,29.1,"her,"],[29.18,29.46,"let's"],[29.56,29.62,"go\""],[29.76,29.76,"I"],[29.8,30.2,"don't"],[30.24,30.58,"wanna"],[30.7,31.2,"let"],[31.28,31.38,"go,"],[32.62,32.9,"girl"],[32.96,33.24,"from"],[33.26,34.02,"734"],[36.06,36.68,"Time,"],[36.8,37.34,"time"],[37.4,37.94,"heals"],[38.08,38.54,"all"],[38.72,39.22,"wounds,"],[39.52,39.8,"but"],[39.88,40.24,"time"],[40.3,40.38,"can"],[40.46,41.0,"leave"],[41.06,41.14,"the"],[41.22,42.1,"nastiest"],[42.18,42.44,"scars"],[42.56,42.88,"This"],[42.98,44.06,"happened"],[44.1